{"title": "Kelemvor's Kiss Branch", "pageid": 34672, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Kelemvor's_Kiss_Branch", "categories": ["Misc items", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Poison_Branch_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/Poison_Branch_Faded.png/300px-Poison_Branch_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/5/53/Poison_Branch_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Kelemvor's Kiss Branch image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/Poison_Branch_Faded.png/300px-Poison_Branch_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/53/Poison_Branch_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Kelemvor's Kiss Branch</b> is a common <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous</a> item used by Nettie to poison the player if they are dishonest with her.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A thorny branch of the Kelemvor's Kiss bush. Though renowned for its deadly effects, the barbs on this branch are discoloured and drained of their poison.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous Items</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-a8aaab6146cb3e8aEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-3c97ac18cab7685bEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-2d77aba47c96d10bEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">CINE_UNI_DEN_PoisonousThorn_A_Cinematic</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:CINE_UNI_DEN_PoisonousThorn_A_Cinematic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:CINE_UNI_DEN_PoisonousThorn_A_Cinematic\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">91c883ff-9c21-4da8-bc34-1eab397e92ab</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:91c883ff-9c21-4da8-bc34-1eab397e92ab\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:91c883ff-9c21-4da8-bc34-1eab397e92ab\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">DEN_PoisonousThorn</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:DEN_PoisonousThorn+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:DEN_PoisonousThorn+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Can be grabbed out of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nettie\" title=\"Nettie\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Nettie.png/25px-Portrait_Nettie.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Nettie.png/38px-Portrait_Nettie.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Nettie.png/50px-Portrait_Nettie.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nettie's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Nettie.png/25px-Portrait_Nettie.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/42/Portrait_Nettie.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nettie\" title=\"Nettie\">Nettie's</a> hands during the quest <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Get_Help_from_Healer_Nettie\" title=\"Get Help from Healer Nettie\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Get Help from Healer Nettie\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Get_Help_from_Healer_Nettie\" title=\"Get Help from Healer Nettie\">Get Help from Healer Nettie</a> if the player character is dishonest with her and allows her to poison them and succeeds on a <a href=\"/wiki/Nature\" title=\"Nature\">Nature</a> check before grabbing the branch from her.</li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>If you get stung by this branch, you receive the condition <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/At_Death%27s_Door_(Emergent)_(Condition)\" title=\"At Death's Door (Emergent) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/At_Death%27s_Door_Emergent_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-At_Death%27s_Door_Emergent_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/At_Death%27s_Door_Emergent_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-At_Death%27s_Door_Emergent_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/At_Death%27s_Door_Emergent_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-At_Death%27s_Door_Emergent_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"At Death's Door\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/At_Death%27s_Door_Emergent_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-At_Death%27s_Door_Emergent_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/At_Death%27s_Door_Emergent_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/At_Death%27s_Door_(Emergent)_(Condition)\" title=\"At Death's Door (Emergent) (Condition)\">At Death's Door</a>, which inflicts a -2 penalty to all <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Scores\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Scores\">Ability Scores</a>, and continues to worsen after <a href=\"/wiki/Resting\" title=\"Resting\">Resting</a>.</li>\n<li>If the player character fails to identify the branch before taking it from Nettie, they receive a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Branch\" title=\"Poison Branch\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Poison_Branch_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Branch_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Poison_Branch_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Poison_Branch_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/17/Poison_Branch_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Poison_Branch_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/17/Poison_Branch_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Branch_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/17/Poison_Branch_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Branch\" title=\"Poison Branch\">Poison Branch</a> instead.</li>\n<li>The item's name appears as <i>Poison Branch</i> in-game, in what may or may not be a bug.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714232339\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.065 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.068 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2350/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 38743/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10068/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.023/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1211928/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   55.817      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   55.817      1 -total\n 42.78%   23.876      8 Template:Icon_text\n 39.32%   21.949     25 Template:Trim\n 19.36%   10.804      3 Template:Uid\n 14.46%    8.069      4 Template:Icon_link\n 13.24%    7.388      1 Template:SmCond\n 11.20%    6.251      1 Template:Main_only\n 11.11%    6.202      1 Template:SmRarityItem\n 10.31%    5.752      3 Template:Template_style\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:34672-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714232339 and revision id 392456. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}